  "steps": [
    "Pressure-cook the sprouts with 1.5 cups of water, turmeric and half the salt for 2 whistles; keep the cooking liquid.",
    "Dry-roast the grated coconut in a pan for 2 minutes and grind it with half of the onion and a little water to a paste.",
    "Heat the oil in a pot, crackle the mustard and cumin seeds, then add hing and curry leaves.",
    "Add the remaining onion and cook until golden, then add the ginger garlic paste and tomato and cook until pulpy.",
    "Add the coconut-onion paste, misal masala and chilli powder and cook for 5 minutes until the oil floats.",
    "Add the cooked sprouts, tamarind pulp, remaining salt and 1.5 cups of water, and simmer for 10 minutes to form a thin rassa.",
    "Serve in bowls topped with sev and coriander leaves."
  ]
